{
 "encounter_id": "00796",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Um, it's my hip, I think. Or my leg? It hurts when I get up from the chair. I forget which side, hang on, the right. The right hip."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take your time. How long has the right hip been painful?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since the summer. About four months. It's mostly after I've been sitting, and then it eases when I get moving."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where exactly is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In the groin, sort of, and down the front of my thigh. A dull ache, sometimes sharp when I stand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it wake you at night? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. Only when I roll onto it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any back pain, or pins and needles down the leg?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my back's fine. No tingling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take for it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day, when I remember. Naproxen, 250 mg, twice a day, and a stomach tablet, lansoprazole, 15 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Osteoarthritis, in my knees, high blood pressure, and an underactive thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does arthritis run in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had a hip replaced at seventy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk the dog twice a day, though it's slower lately."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 70, blood pressure 138 over 82, temperature 36.5, oxygen 98 percent, weight 79 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Now I'll move your hip. Lie back.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ow, there. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The right hip is stiff and painful on turning it inwards, and a bit restricted compared with the left."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it the arthritis? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With the groin pain, the stiffness after sitting, and the limited inward rotation, this fits with osteoarthritis of the hip, I'd say."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will I need a replacement? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not necessarily, it depends how it progresses. First, I'd like an X-ray of your right hip, and of your pelvis, to see how much the joint has changed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to arrange a physiotherapy assessment, because strengthening exercises help a lot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I keep taking the tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, but I'd suggest the paracetamol regularly, with the naproxen only when it's bad, and with food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try, I forget. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Put the paracetamol next to your toothbrush. And a walking stick in your left hand will take some load off the right hip."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A stick. Hm. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It helps more than you'd expect. I'd like to see you in six weeks, with the X-ray results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
